{{Tab
|title= ===== Graphical {{project_name_gateway_short}} SYSMAINT Session =====
|image=[[File:{{project_name_short}}-logo-icon.svg|25px]]
|content= <u>If you are using a graphical {{project_name_gateway_short}} booted into <code>PERSISTENT Mode {{!}} SYSMAINT Session</code></u>, take the following step.

<code>System Maintenance Panel</code> -> <code>Open Terminal</code> -> run <code>/usr/libexec/gateway-shortcuts/torrc</code>
}} <!-- close tab -->

{{Tab
|title= ===== Graphical {{project_name_gateway_short}} Unrestricted Admin Mode =====
|image=[[File:{{project_name_short}}-logo-icon.svg|25px]]
|content= <u>If you are using a graphical {{project_name_gateway_short}}</u> and enabled {{kicksecure_wiki
|wikipage=unrestricted_admin_mode
|text=unrestricted admin mode
}}, take the following step.

<code>Start Menu</code> -> <code>System Tools</code> -> <code>Tor User Config</code>
}} <!-- close tab -->

{{Tab
|title= ===== Terminal {{project_name_gateway_short}} =====
|image=[[File:Utilities-terminal.png|25px]]
|content= <u>If you are using {{project_name_gateway_short}} with {{cli}}</u>, take the following step.
{{CodeSelect|code=
sudoedit /usr/local/etc/torrc.d/50_user.conf
}}
}} <!-- close tab -->

