|image=[[File:Qubes-logo-icon.png|25px]]
|content= <u>If you are using [[Qubes|{{q_project_name_long}}]] with a graphical desktop</u>, take the following step.

<code>Qubes App Launcher (blue/grey "Q")</code> -> <code>Service</code> -> <code>{{project_name_gateway_long}} ProxyVM (commonly named {{project_name_gateway_vm}})</code> -> <code>Tor User Config</code>
}} <!-- close tab -->

{{Tab
|title= ===== Terminal Qubes-Whonix =====
|image=[[File:Utilities-terminal.png|25px]]
|content= <u>If you are using [[Qubes|{{q_project_name_long}}]] with a terminal</u>, open a terminal in <code>{{project_name_gateway_vm}}</code> and run the following command.

{{CodeSelect|code=
sudoedit /usr/local/etc/torrc.d/50_user.conf
}}
